@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> UnregisteredState

state "UnregisteredState" as UnregisteredState
UnregisteredState : entry / user is not logged in and has not registered yet

state RegisteringState
RegisteringState : entry / user is registering a new account
RegisteringState : do / collect personal details
RegisteringState : exit / [SuccessfulRegistrationEvent, InvalidRegistrationEvent]

state LoginState
LoginState : entry / user is logging into their existing account or starting fresh after failure
LoginState : do / check credentials
LoginState : exit / [ValidLocationEvent, InvalidLocationEvent]

state "InvalidLocationState" as InvalidLocationState
InvalidLocationState : entry / entered location is invalid
InvalidLocationState : do / inform user of error
InvalidLocationState : exit / back to LoginState

state "ValidLocationState" as ValidLocationState
ValidLocationState : entry / entered location is valid
ValidLocationState : do / allow user to choose what weather information to check
ValidLocationState : exit / WeatherSelectionEvent

state WeatherSelectionState
WeatherSelectionState : entry / user has chosen what weather information to check
WeatherSelectionState : do / update and show the selected weather information to the user
WeatherSelectionState : exit / AdditionalDetailsEvent, LogoutEvent

state "AdditionalDetailsState" as AdditionalDetailsState
AdditionalDetailsState : entry / user wants to view additional weather details
AdditionalDetailsState : do / display additional weather details (alerts, a weekly analysis, a future prediction, or a graph)
AdditionalDetailsState : exit / back to WeatherSelectionState

state LoggedOutState
LoggedOutState : entry / user logs out and ends the session
LoggedOutState : do / logout process
LoggedOutState : exit / [*]

UnregisteredState --> RegisteringState
RegisteringState --> LoginState
LoginState --> InvalidLocationState
InvalidLocationState --> LoginState
LoginState --> ValidLocationState
ValidLocationState --> WeatherSelectionState
WeatherSelectionState --> AdditionalDetailsState
AdditionalDetailsState --> WeatherSelectionState
LoggedOutState --> [*]
@enduml
